window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I didn’t know I was a captive. How could I? I didn’t have my memory. He could have told me anything about the world, and he did.</p> <p>And I believed him.</p> <p>Until the day a mysterious stranger showed up, killed the man I’d believed was my husband, and decided to take me with him.</p> <p>I don’t know what he plans to do with me, but it can’t be anything good.</p> <p>But hey, at least the world still exists.</p> <p><i>The Monster Keeps Me Safe</i> is a dark romance stand-alone with an HEA and <i>no </i>cliff-hangers.</p> <p>Tropes: mistaken identities, kidnap, contract killer.</p>"; 
